  "notes": "Cause code left TBD/provisional per FORM-366 fields; narrative attributes root cause to a cable splice fault but no official cause code was assigned. Unit 1 was in refueling outage (defueled) at time of event; Unit 2 unaffected, continued at 100% power, and is modeled only via note in consequence context (no separate Unit 2 node created since narrative frames it as unaffected/no operational challenge). #3 EDG is shared between Unit 1 and Unit 2 'J' buses per design; only its role in this event (auto-start/load) is modeled. Dedicated per-unit EDGs for H buses are design-context only (no operability statement during event) and are not modeled as BACKED_UP_BY targets; only the stated 'all systems other than A RSST remained available' supports general availability but no specific backup system is named as engaged, so no BACKED_UP_BY edge asserted beyond noting in chain text."
